</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Father, we need no goodness more than Thee,</l><l>Nor do we seek a love that’s less than Thine;</l><l>How we adore Thee now that here we know</l><l>Thy searchless, uncreated life divine.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Father, within Thy love our love to Thee</l><l>Grows, far transcending all our earthly ties;</l><l>Thine own dear love in power leads our hearts</l><l>Where Thine own presence deeply satisfies.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Father, by joining with Thy Son beloved,</l><l>We all with gladness praise Thee now again;</l><l>Joyfully feasting on Thy holy love,</l><l>Tasting, as sons, the sweetness of Thy name.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
